			paket:: AP03
			krav:: PIM-W01; PIM-W02; PIM-W03; PIM-W04; PIM-W05; PIM-W06; PIM-W07; PIM-W08; PIM-W09; PIM-Q03; PIM-Q04; PIM-D04; PIM-D06
